A lacuna type that isn't one of LacunaTypes ("Guess", line 9 of 1.0), caught by
CUE in thema's kernel (Lacuna's type!: or([...])) as an empty disjunction.

Each alternative is its own error, citing the authored value and four kernel
positions. The summary error has no position.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	title: string
	count?: int
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	title: string
	count: int & <10
}

forward: {
	count: from.count
	lacuna: {
		kind: "Guess"
		target: "count"
		message: "count is a placeholder"
	}
}

backward: {
	count: to.count
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
schema: {
	title: string
	count: int & <10
}

forward: {
	count: from.count
	lacuna: {
		kind:    "Guess"
		target:  "count"
		message: "count is a placeholder"
	}
}

backward: {
	count: to.count
}
-- out/error --
the lacuna's type is "Guess", which is not a lacuna type:
    ship/history/1.0.thema:9:9
